hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1430","Muhammad bin Yahya and Zakaria bin Yahya bin Aban told us, they said: Ibn Abi Maryam told us, Muhammad bin Jafar told us, he told me Zaid, who is Ibn Aslam, on the authority of Iyad bin Abdullah, on the authority of Abu Sa`id al-Khudri, who said: “The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, went out in Adha or breaking the fast, he went to the prayer place, led them in prayer, and then left.”"
